{"ID":"20240220132646-83ksqi0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132646-83ksqi0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132646-83ksqi0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145823-577zt37\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145823-fo7txc1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312145823-24tjtrl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:254,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:254\u0026#125;","title":"【葛根加半夏汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312145823-577zt37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-577zt37","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145823-ma8cfr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-ma8cfr6","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳」与「阳明」合病,不但下利,而呕者,「葛根加半夏汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145823-we5s2ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-we5s2ys","updated":"20240312145823"}},{"ID":"20240312145823-x8fmtfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-x8fmtfp","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根加半夏汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145823-l8sjpq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-l8sjpq8","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根四两，麻黄三两,汤泡去黄汁,焙干秤，桂枝二两，芍药二两，甘草二两炙，生姜二两，大枣十二枚劈，生半夏半斤洗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145823-vsfjpiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-vsfjpiq","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右八味,以水一斗,先煮麻黄,葛根,减二升,去白沫,内诸药,煮取三升,去滓,温服一升,覆取微似汗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312145823-ll5etsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-ll5etsw","updated":"20240312145823"}},{"ID":"20240312145823-24tjtrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-24tjtrl","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加了半夏是止呕，为什么？张仲景用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生半夏，半斤，所谓生的，就是当场采下来用的半斤，因为生的刚采下来湿的还很重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以现在剂量我们不能按照这个，待会我告诉你如何使用剂量。生半夏是毒药，有名的婆婆药，生半夏吃下去不会死人的，只是声音没了，生半夏无味，解半夏的毒就要靠生姜。生半夏涤水力量非常强，一下去，恶心马上去掉了。中药里面只有生半夏可以把脑部的积水排掉。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生半夏可以去至高的水，脑部的水。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最高的水要靠生半夏，恶心要靠生半夏。经方用生半夏很多。生半夏是毒没错，但是生半夏我们在用的时候都是跟生姜或者干姜在一起用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312145823-9ibr9q4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-9ibr9q4","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汤剂解表的时候，一定是覆取微似汗，一定是感觉有汗，实际上没汗，刚刚好，就是病出来了，但是没有伤到津液，恰到好处。这是最高的境界；"}]},{"ID":"20240312145823-fo7txc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312145823-fo7txc1","updated":"20240312145823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里讲是半斤，我们真正拿到手上是已经风干了，一般说干的半夏三钱。"}]}]}